  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Lewis concept \"Acids are electron acceptor and bases are electron donor\" Since, electron deficient compounds also have an ability to accept electrons, these are regarded as acids.<br />Trimethylborane \\((\\mathrm{CH})_3\\) B have incomplete octet thus, act as Lewis acid.<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/kjxc7ecut7tvvcfsre4.png\">",
